    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d612-a2">

                <pb facs="1258" n="1246" xml:id="pg1246"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex 2]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Appendix</hi> IX</head>
                <p>In accordance with paragraph 6, the Chinese Communist Party agrees that in
                    implementing the Army Reorganization Agreement the Communist troops will not be
                    concentrated into or garrison any locality within the following areas:— <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p><hi rendition="#italic">Anhwei:</hi> northeastern part</p>
                        <p><hi rendition="#italic">Kiangsu:</hi> latitudinally south of Hwaian
                            exclusive</p>
                        <p><hi rendition="#italic">Shantung:</hi> 1. Tsaochuang Area</p>
                        <p>2. Tsingtao–Tsinan railway line</p>
                        <p><hi rendition="#italic">Chahar:</hi> South of the latitude of Kalgan
                            exclusive</p>
                        <p><hi rendition="#italic">Jehol:</hi> South of the latitude at Chengteh
                            exclusive</p>
                        <p><hi rendition="#italic">Hupeh–Honan Border Area:</hi> The Communist
                            troops in that area will be moved to Hopei</p>
                    </quote></p>
            </div>
        </body>
